      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "什锦烧是菱钻奇宝喜欢的东西，\n同时也是幸福的象征。\n她只要有一点小小的幸福就满足了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d548542d4154967c525d7e953bc2be60775d469b7c192a40d2a0a190732094b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
