    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50bca9cc29b225fd371f4917",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的菱钻奇宝并不适合快速地往上爬，\n因此决定到经典级的五月为止，\n都要悠闲地参加比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "703cdb87f8d8143e18929be9767fba479367f1eb5f16868b194300f1f30370c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4465c380f7183ad70f96e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・为了庆祝里面全部都有",
