      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce45fe60d7dd0c61a0e2554f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对同期的破坏神谷野美酒和\n职业级专家吉兆，\n还是没办法萌生竞争心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c51605d7fb3c914cef5cf768ccdc2f7a6b62ac743877b8a17f8149230c7f801",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb787d3916d21fde9a9ae5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d3303246cf468e9b5334e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所缺少的是“觉悟”，\n而且明明有好好在“努力”，\n却没有自觉到自己所做的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd01ba1eab4350337c4a462474f1d301f7fcc7f4d587efb13242722c44f2c3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71adf08e160f8e41169f231f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a217e29e65b0876706d87d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "知道自己有在努力才会带来自信。\n在下次的目标“神户报杯”之前，\n训练员决定要对菱钻奇宝进行意识改革。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1021861885f8b3b53e675183fb246456a14e192f47aa060ba22fc6aae2bd2f6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07af42d247568569ec188331",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・不算数的努力",
      "source_fingerprint": "94cad849cb9fa387703505baf8f9ce20c8c1001e9626d0c7f0dfb543aa886000",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0880d4c648dc2e7ead52282e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后，吉兆宣布\n她下一场比赛不是“菊花赏”，而是要以古马级\n也会参加的“天皇赏（秋）”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19d5c747921ad88cd92f304df3cfbc5a412146e60c8753bfa023df978ef4d580",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e84e344fc24846a74f7f0d15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如此一来“菊花赏”的二强都缺席了。\n虽然是个绝佳的机会，\n但菱钻奇宝还是不太愿意出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5544298d085a62c4ba44371aea42475d29ca93bbb6bcd2134d23b6dd19a49a10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2592dab5b42b72a9cfee87f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是训练员说，就算很勉强也要参赛比较好，\n在半推半就的情况下，决定要参加“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8e647f0a6de1db8e792d5c798b8d4fc107f06d6b42fd3f34f7e4b84e26fceb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f111d9853994784f03cbfe3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神户报杯结束后・惊人的转折！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1530854314cd4dc5e517acd283b5e3fe8fc2a192ceda2731b8be56a979a6ce05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1106/storytimeline_501106420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
