    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c7b4ec41761eeec4ec92afb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为长途跑者的资质盛大地绽放了。\n菱钻奇宝在这个大舞台上，\n达成了奇迹的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "666d5e567ef7854c65db056b4696d13e82c500f34bb1c879d2268b215d349187",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
