      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她差不多该成为\n能自己决定目标的赛马娘，\n受到训练员这样请托后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "619f915e7be511a6926ff2d188f8560b06032a97bcd32dada85c0c5da604d8b8",
